1
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:12,147
Honey, have you seen my car keys?

2
00:00:12,147 --> 00:00:15,477
Did you lose them again?

3
00:00:15,477 --> 00:00:19,346
We're going to be late to Gus's party!

4
00:00:19,346 --> 00:00:22,172
So can you help me find them?

5
00:00:22,172 --> 00:00:27,242
I swear, you couldn't find your keys if they were\h
in front of your face!

6
00:00:27,242 --> 00:00:28,905
Are they in your pocket?

7
00:00:28,905 --> 00:00:31,708
No, that's the first place I checked.

8
00:00:31,708 --> 00:00:33,782
I've looked\heverywhere!

9
00:00:33,782 --> 00:00:37,317
They're not on the table or on the bookshelf.

10
00:00:37,317 --> 00:00:39,498
That's where I usually leave them.

11
00:00:39,498 --> 00:00:41,764
Hmmm, okay.

12
00:00:41,764 --> 00:00:45,114
