13
00:00:47,456 --> 00:00:49,220
On the counter?

14
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:52,579
No, they were by the coffee maker.

15
00:00:54,464 --> 00:00:57,542
Hmmm... They are not here.

16
00:00:57,542 --> 00:01:00,542
Maybe they are in the sink?

17
00:01:00,542 --> 00:01:02,334
Ha ha...

18
00:01:02,334 --> 00:01:07,353
I'm going to look in the fridge… just in case.

19
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,496
Maybe they are in the living room!

20
00:01:12,419 --> 00:01:14,833
They're not behind the TV...

21
00:01:16,163 --> 00:01:18,620
or under the coffee table.

22
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:22,409
Did you look between the sofa cushions?

23
00:01:22,409 --> 00:01:29,443
I did, and they're not on, in, or under the sofa.

24
00:01:29,443 --> 00:01:31,921
Okay, let's see.

25
00:01:31,921 --> 00:01:34,667
Maybe you\hdropped them behind the plant?

26
00:01:34,667 --> 00:01:36,253
Which plant?

27
00:01:36,253 --> 00:01:38,892
The one near the patio door,

28
00:01:38,892 --> 00:01:42,042
or the one beside Archie's food dish?

29
00:01:42,042 --> 00:01:44,528
The one near the patio door.

30
00:01:44,528 --> 00:01:47,534
No, they are not there.

31
00:01:47,534 --> 00:01:52,613
I'm going to look in the garage. Do you mind looking in the bedroom?

32
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:59,167
Hmm, they're not on top of the car,

33
00:01:59,167 --> 00:02:01,411
or under it…

34
00:02:02,483 --> 00:02:07,959
They're not in front of the car, or behind it…

35
00:02:07,959 --> 00:02:10,693
They're not by the door…

36
00:02:13,243 --> 00:02:15,707
Not under the bed…

37
00:02:15,707 --> 00:02:18,189
Not Under the sheets.

38
00:02:18,983 --> 00:02:20,661
I'm sorry, dear.

39
00:02:20,661 --> 00:02:24,370
I'll call Gus\hand tell him we'll be late.

40
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:26,716
Oh…

41
00:02:26,716 --> 00:02:33,341
Um… I guess I didn't\hcheck in my pocket, after all…

42
00:02:33,341 --> 00:02:35,954
Ah, ok… no problem!

43
00:02:35,954 --> 00:02:40,467
Just don't forget to tell\hGus you're sleeping at his house tonight!

